    "body": "Thanks @davidkna for the update! \r\n\r\nUnfortunately I'm now having a problem with zvariant dependency : \r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nUpdating starship\r\n    Updating crates.io index\r\n  Installing starship v1.10.2\r\nerror: failed to compile `starship v1.10.2`, intermediate artifacts can be found at `/tmp/cargo-installH58CGv`\r\n\r\nCaused by:\r\n  package `zvariant v3.6.0` cannot be built because it requires rustc 1.60 or newer, while the currently active rustc version is 1.59.0\r\n```\r\n",
